      "description": "The maker's own recipe, brewed upright: a heaping scoop of medium-fine coffee, water to the 4 mark, a 3-second stir, the plunger in to stop the drip, a 30-second wait (60 for pre-ground coffee), then a gentle press until the hiss. The water amount is an estimate for the 4 mark.",
      "defaults": {
